@startuml
title Component Diagram - Refactored Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "network_app" as App {
    [app/main.cpp]
}

component "network_core" as Core {
    [Graph]
    [GraphAlgorithms]
    [Network Model]
    [NetworkSimulator]
}

component "tests_runner" as Tests {
    [GoogleTest tests]
}

component "Doxygen Documentation" as Docs
component "UML Diagrams" as UML
database "GitHub Repository" as Repo

App --> Core : uses
Tests --> Core : tests
Tests --> [GoogleTest] : uses
Docs --> Core : extracts API docs
UML --> Core : describes structure and behavior

Repo o-- App
Repo o-- Core
Repo o-- Tests
Repo o-- Docs
Repo o-- UML

note right of Core
Core logic was extracted into
a reusable interface library:
network_core
end note

@enduml
